{
  "page_id": "EM-47",
  "section_header": "ENGINE MECHANICAL — Cylinder Block",
  "title": "ENGINE MECHANICAL — Cylinder Block",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Installation of main bearing caps on cylinder block with crankshaft",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 3,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(h) Install the main bearing caps. Torque the cap bolts."
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Main bearing cap bolts",
      "value": "1,040 kg-cm (75 ft-lb, 102 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "Do not turn crankshaft."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Removal of main bearing caps and measurement of plastigauge",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 32,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(i) Remove the main bearing caps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(j) Measure the plastigauge at its widest point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Standard clearance: 0.034 — 0.058 mm"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(0.0013 — 0.0023 in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Maximum clearance: 0.08 mm (0.0031 in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If the clearance is greater than maximum, replace the bearings and/or grind the main journals."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Undersized bearing: U/S 0.25, 0.50"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Cylinder block and crankshaft bearing numbering system showing Front arrow and numbered journals",
      "labels": [
        "Front",
        "No. 7 Journal",
        "No. 5, No. 6",
        "No. 3 Journal",
        "No. 1, No. 2 Cylinder",
        "1, 2, 3, 4 or 5",
        "No. 6 — No. 7 Journal",
        "No. 1 — No. 4 Journal"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 61,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 45
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "If replacing a standard size bearing with a standard oil clearance, replace with one having the same numbers stamped. If the numbers of the bearing cannot be determined, select a bearing from the table below according to the numbers imprinted on the cylinder block and crankshaft."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "",
      "headers": [
        "Cylinder Block No.",
