        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Example: Cylinder Block No. 2, Crankshaft No. 1 = Bearing No. 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "21. REMOVE CRANKSHAFT"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Lift out the crankshaft.",
        "(b) Remove the upper main bearings from the cylinder block.",
        "(c) Clean out any plastigauge scraps from the bearing and journals."
      ]
    }
  ]
